; Title screen countdown (word)
;
; Counts the passes of the title-screen loop in #R$6000 that remain before the demo starts. #R$6000 sets it to 140
; ($008C) when the title screen is drawn and decrements it once per pass of the colour-cycling loop (each pass takes
; about 4 frames: the rising tone of #R$6A77 is the delay). When it reaches 0 the demo starts, with #R$6B0B left at 0; a
; key pressed before that sets #R$6B0B to 1 and starts a real game at once. Not used outside the title loop; the loaded
; value 0 is never read.
;
@label=TitleCountdown
g$6B08 DEFW $0000
